# The Final Seal (Windurst 5-1, mission.windurst.the_final_seal) played through: a level 75 Windurstian at rank 5, ACP
# and RoV current (their zone-ins quiet) and the nation's missions before it completed, the Message to Jeuno held. _6q2
# 166 (progress), option 0: begun, status 10, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION, the New Fei'Yin Seal, the message taken. Fei'Yin's
# zone-in 1 (status 11); Qu'Bia Arena area 1, the Archlich killed: allDeath, WON, 32001: Archmage Assassin and the
# mission's finish (the Burnt Seal, status 12). _6q2 192: completed (600 rank points, the Burnt Seal taken); then the
# zone's default VESTAL_CHAMBERS_LOCKED (310).
lists WindurstWaters/Mokyokyo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Janshura-Rashura/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Zokima-Rokima/onTrigger HeavensTower/_6q2/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/166 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/190 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/192 Feiyin/onZoneIn/1 Feiyin/onEventFinish/1 QubiaArena/BC_Entrance/onTrigger QubiaArena/Burning_Circle/onTrigger QubiaArena/onEventUpdate/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32003 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32001 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32002
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0.1,30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
mission Windurst ToEachHisOwnRight completed
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
mission Windurst ANewJourney completed
mission Windurst Magicite completed
rank 5
keyitem MessageToJeunoWindurst
login
trigger _6q2                            # section 1, the message held: 166 (progress)
finish option=0                         # begun: status 10, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION, the seal; the message taken
warp -51.0,-16.0,38.0 Feiyin open       # status 10: 1
finish                                  # status 11
warp -212.2,-24.6,20.1 QubiaArena
trigger BC_Entrance                     # the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: entered
finish
tick 2000                               # the first tick: the groups spawn
kill ARCHLICH_TABERQUOAN                # the Archlich: allDeath, WON
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish                                  # 32001: the title, the mission's 32001 finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower
trigger _6q2                            # status 12, the Burnt Seal: 192
finish                                  # completed: 600 rank points, the Burnt Seal taken
trigger _6q2                            # completed: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
